8:["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"cmd/compile/internal/noder"}]
9:["$","li","li-4",{"children":["这个阶段使用自己的 AST 定义和 Go 类型的表示，这些定义和表示形式是用 C 编写时遗留下来的。它的所有代码都是根据这些编写的，因此类型检查后的下一步是转换语法和 ",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"types2"}]," 表示形式到 ",["$","code","code-1",{"className":"$undefined","children":"ir"}]," 和 ",["$","code","code-2",{"className":"$undefined","children":"types"}],"。这个过程被称为“noding”。"]}]
a:["$","li","li-3",{"children":["\n",["$","p","p-0",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"中间阶段"}],":"]}],"\n",["$","ul","ul-0",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"死代码消除"}]," (",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"cmd/compile/internal/deadcode"}],")"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"函数调用内联"}]," (",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"cmd/compile/internal/inline"}],")"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-2",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"已知接口方法调用的去虚拟化"}]," (",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"cmd/compile/internal/devirtualize"}],")"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-3",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"逃逸分析"}]," (",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"cmd/compile/internal/escape"}],")"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-4",{"children":"在 IR 表示上执行几个优化过程：死代码消除、（早期的）去虚拟化、函数调用内联和逃逸分析。"}],"\n"]}],"\n"]}]
b:["$","li","li-4",{"children":["\n",["$","p","p-0",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"Walk"}]," (",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"cmd/compile/internal/walk"}],"):"]}],"\n",["$","ul","ul-0",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"求值顺序和语法糖"}],"：这是对 IR 表示的最后一次遍历，它有两个目的：将复杂的语句分解为简单的单个语句，引入临时变量并遵守求值顺序；将高级 Go 构造转换为更原始的构造。"]}],"\n"]}],"\n"]}]
c:["$","li","li-5",{"children":["\n",["$","p","p-0",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"通用 SSA"}]," (",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"cmd/compile/internal/ssa"}]," 和 ",["$","code","code-1",{"className":"$undefined","children":"cmd/compile/internal/ssagen"}],"):"]}],"\n",["$","ul","ul-0",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":"在这个阶段，IR 被转换为静态单赋值（SSA）形式，这是一种具有特定属性的低级中间表示，使得从中实现优化并最终生成机器代码变得更容易。"}],"\n"]}],"\n"]}]
d:["$","li","li-6",{"children":["\n",["$","p","p-0",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"生成机器代码"}]," (",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"cmd/compile/internal/ssa"}]," 和 ",["$","code","code-1",{"className":"$undefined","children":"cmd/internal/obj"}],"):"]}],"\n",["$","ul","ul-0",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":["这是编译器的机器依赖阶段，以“lower”过程开始，将通用值重写为它们的机器特定变体。然后进行最终的代码优化过程。最后，Go 函数被转换为一系列 ",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"obj.Prog"}]," 指令，这些指令被汇编器（",["$","code","code-1",{"className":"$undefined","children":"cmd/internal/obj"}],"）转换为机器代码，并写出最终的目标文件。"]}],"\n"]}],"\n"]}]
e:["$","p","p-2",{"children":["$","$L10c","img-0",{"src":"https://hedonspace.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/img5eRkfKJ8cMojTjPoZzjr1i-20231129143006857.png","alt":"Go编译器概览","node":{"type":"element","tagName":"img","properties":{"src":"https://hedonspace.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/img5eRkfKJ8cMojTjPoZzjr1i-20231129143006857.png","alt":"Go编译器概览"},"children":[],"position":{"start":{"line":47,"column":1,"offset":1527},"end":{"line":47,"column":107,"offset":1633}}}}]}]
f:["$","h2","h2-2",{"id":"编译过程","children":["$","a","a-0",{"href":"#编译过程","node":{"type":"element","tagName":"a","properties":{"href":"#编译过程"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"编译过程","position":{"start":{"line":49,"column":4,"offset":1638},"end":{"line":49,"column":8,"offset":1642}}}]},"children":"编译过程"}]}]
10:["$","p","p-3",{"children":"Go 程序的编译过程符合经典编译原理的过程拆解，即三阶段编译器，分别为编译器前端、中端和后端："}]
11:["$","ul","ul-1",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"前端（Front End）："}]," 前端的任务是进行语法分析和语义分析。这一阶段会将源代码转换为一个中间表示。在这个过程中，编译器会检查代码的语法和语义，比如语法错误、类型错误等。前端通常是依赖于具体语言的，比如 Go 的前端和 C++ 的前端就会有很大的不同。"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"中间端（Middle End）："}]," 中间端的任务是对中间表示进行优化。这一阶段的优化是语言无关的，比如常量折叠、死代码消除、循环优化等。这些优化可以提高生成的代码的性能，但是不会改变程序的语义。"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-2",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"后端（Back End）："}]," 后端的任务是将优化后的中间表示转换为目标机器代码。这一阶段会进行更多的优化，比如寄存器分配、指令选择、指令调度等。后端通常是依赖于具体机器的，比如 x86 的后端和 ARM 的后端就会有很大的不同。"]}],"\n"]}]
12:["$","p","p-4",{"children":"参考《Go 语言底层原理剖析（郑建勋）》一书，本文将 Go 语言编译器执行流程拆分为以下几个阶段："}]
