f2:["$","p","p-119",{"children":["在 SSA 阶段，编译器先执行与特定指令集无关的优化，再执行与特定指令集有关的优化，并最终生成与特定指令集有关的指令和寄存器分配方式。如 ",["$","a","a-0",{"href":"https://github.com/golang/go/blob/release-branch.go1.21/src/cmd/compile/internal/ssa/_gen/genericOps.go","node":{"type":"element","tagName":"a","properties":{"href":"https://github.com/golang/go/blob/release-branch.go1.21/src/cmd/compile/internal/ssa/_gen/genericOps.go"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"ssa/_gen/genericOps.go","position":{"start":{"line":1876,"column":71,"offset":48119},"end":{"line":1876,"column":94,"offset":48142}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":1876,"column":70,"offset":48118},"end":{"line":1876,"column":200,"offset":48248}}},"target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer","children":"ssa/_gen/genericOps.go"}]," 中包含了与特定指令集无关的 Op 操作，在 ",["$","a","a-1",{"href":"https://github.com/golang/go/blob/release-branch.go1.21/src/cmd/compile/internal/ssa/_gen/S390XOps.go","node":{"type":"element","tagName":"a","properties":{"href":"https://github.com/golang/go/blob/release-branch.go1.21/src/cmd/compile/internal/ssa/_gen/S390XOps.go"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"ssa/_gen/AMD64Ops.go","position":{"start":{"line":1876,"column":224,"offset":48272},"end":{"line":1876,"column":245,"offset":48293}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":1876,"column":223,"offset":48271},"end":{"line":1876,"column":349,"offset":48397}}},"target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer","children":"ssa/_gen/AMD64Ops.go"}]," 中包含了和 AMD64 指令集相关的 Op 操作。"]}]
